  "full_passage_spoken": "Autumn is cool. A leaf turns orange. Leaves fall down in the wind. The sky is clear. I pick fruit. I wear a sweater. I like autumn. Cool wind makes the orange leaf fall. The clear sky is high and blue. I pick fruit, and then I put on a sweater. I like autumn because it is cool and clear.",
  "topic_zh": "秋天",
